        "hidden": false,
        "typeId": "9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64",
        "typeName": "Abilities",
        "characteristics": [
         {
          "name": "Description",
          "$text": "WHEN: Fight phase or your Shooting phase, when a unit from your army is selected to shoot or fight.\nTARGET: That ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit.\nEFFECT: That unit's attacks have [SUSTAINED HITS 1], and add 1 to the Wound roll if the target is a VEHICLE.",
